{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"easter_eggs/menus/16010371_1_1.kr.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"easter_eggs/menu_16010371:1:1","lang":"kr","texts":{"menu:510100328:1":{"text":"맙소사! 제... 제가 정말 보이시나요? 정말 보이세요?!","source_cn":"天哪！您……您能看见我？您真的能看见我？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender_keys_same"}},"speakers":{"speaker:幽灵鸽子":{"text":"유령 비둘기","source":"幽灵鸽子","status":"exact_hash"}}},"locales/kr/ep6/env_story/16311500.json":{"asset_key":"ep6/env_story_16311500","episode":"ep6","category":"env_story","story_id":"16311500","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1631150001:0":{"text":"여기 왜 이렇게 음산한 거 같냐...","source_cn":"怎么感觉这里阴风阵阵的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54A5533EDF518624","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:学生":{"text":"학생","source":"学生","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep6/env_story/16311510.json":{"asset_key":"ep6/env_story_16311510","episode":"ep6","category":"env_story","story_id":"16311510","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1631151001:0":{"text":"와! 드디어 제 말을 들을 수 있는 사람이 나타났네요! 제가... 여기서 얼마나 있었는지 모르겠어요. 몇 년? 아니, 몇십 년 있었나?","source_cn":"太好了！终于有人能听见我说话了！我……我不知道在这里待...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA658B0CAE100761","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1631151002:0":{"text":"제가 죽었다는 건 알고 있어요. 원래는... 더 넓은 곳으로 가야 했단 말이죠. 거긴 해바라기 씨앗이 엄청 많다고 들었어요!","source_cn":"我死了，这我很清楚，但我本来应该去一个……一个更宽敞的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA30890D7B9BC823","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1631151003:0":{"text":"문제는 제가 길치라는 거예요. 길치요! 방향을 잘못 잡아서 이 선반으로 가득 찬 미로 같은 곳으로 들어와서... 나갈 길을 못 찾고 있어요!","source_cn":"可我是个路痴，您明白吗？彻头彻尾的路痴！我飞错了方向，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE07528DF364C4D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1631151004:1":{"text":"여러 번 시도해 봤지만, 벽을 통과해도 밖은 여전히 방이고, 여전히 복도였어요! 계속 같은 곳만 빙글빙글 돌고 있나 봐요!","source_cn":"我试过很多次，可每次穿过墙壁，外面还是房间，还是走廊！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDADF4EA632790EE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1631151005:1":{"text":"친절하신 마법사님, 혹시... 저 좀 도와주실 수 있나요?","source_cn":"善良的<male>先生</male><female>女...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA94777C82B746533","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"친절하신 마법사님, 혹시... 저 좀 도와주실 수 있나요?","female":"친절하신 마법사님, 혹시... 저 좀 도와주실 수 있나요?","variant_male_record_index":"212310","variant_female_record_index":"212311","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1631151006:0":{"text":"평온한 기운이 가득한 창문 밖으로 나가면 올바른 길을 찾을 수 있다고 들었어요.","source_cn":"我听说，只要从一扇充满安宁气息的窗户飞出去，就能找到正...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54ABFE7E6F4B2E7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1631151006":{"text":"평온한 기운이 가득한 창문 밖으로 나가면 올바른 길을 찾을 수 있다고 들었어요.","so